  "body": "**Link to problem area**:\n\nhttps://spec.matrix.org/latest/client-server-api/#key-storage\n\n**Issue**\n\n10.13.1.1 (Key storage) says this:\n\n> If no default key is specified, the client may behave as if there is no key is present at all.\n\nSuggested change:\n\n> If no default key is specified, the client may behave as if ~~there is~~ no key is present at all.\n\nI started to create a PR myself, but the hoops regarding required changelog entries turned out to be too much of a PITA. It would be nice if that requirement was waived or automated for minor corrections like spelling and grammar.",
